  "notes": "WO-298 pet skill catalog content. v2 adds the 'branch' grouping (harvest|combat|utility|aura|signature), numeric 'magnitude'/'magnitudeType' balance fields, per-node 'cost' (skill points), and 'questItem' apex gates per DESIGN_PET_SYSTEM.md §4. Each species exposes the four design branches plus one signature apex node at Level 15 (Aether Fox 18, rare/late) requiring a quest item. The three original elemental species (aether-sprite/flame-pup/ice-wolf) retain their React-ported combat skills, now branch-tagged and extended with harvest/utility/aura nodes + signature. Eight design species (sproutling, craghound, frostkit, emberpup, mirewing, glimmermoth, stoneback-calf, aether-fox) added with full four-branch trees. Balance: passive bonuses are additive and modest (yield/speed +8-12%, damage-reduction 10-20%, carry +3-12, heal 2-5/sec); signatures are role-defining but bounded (offline +30%, ability-cost -10-12%, wall-DR -25%). Effects route via magnitudeType to EconomyService/aura/combat runtimes (WO-298 runtime wiring is additive/follow-up; this WO is catalog content)."
}
